  /// "DBEngineVersions[].EngineVersion" To list all of the available engine
  /// versions for RDS for MySQL, use the following command: aws rds
  /// describe-db-engine-versions --engine mysql --query
  /// "DBEngineVersions[].EngineVersion" To list all of the available engine
  /// versions for RDS for PostgreSQL, use the following command: aws rds
  /// describe-db-engine-versions --engine postgres --query
