  /// the DB snapshot or DB cluster snapshot in SnapshotIdentifier isn't
  /// encrypted, then the restored DB cluster isn't encrypted. Valid for:
  /// Aurora DB clusters and Multi-AZ DB clusters
  pub kms_key_id: Str? = None
  /// Specifies whether to enable mapping of Amazon Web Services Identity and
  /// Access Management (IAM) accounts to database accounts. By default,
  /// mapping isn't enabled. For more information, see IAM Database
  /// Authentication in the Amazon Aurora User Guide or IAM database
  /// authentication for MariaDB, MySQL, and PostgreSQL in the Amazon RDS User
  /// Guide . Valid for: Aurora DB clusters and Multi-AZ DB clusters
