  /// Amazon Web Services Regions, or for all database engines. For the full
  /// list of DB instance classes, and availability for your engine, see DB
  /// Instance Class in the Amazon RDS User Guide . Default: The same DB
  /// instance class as the original DB instance.
  pub db_instance_class: Str? = None
  /// The port number on which the database accepts connections. Default: The
  /// same port as the original DB instance. Constraints: The value must be
  /// 1150-65535 .
  pub port: Int? = None
  /// The Availability Zone (AZ) where the DB instance will be created.
