  /// Web Services License Manager self-managed license. The Db2 license
  /// through Amazon Web Services Marketplace model requires an Amazon Web
  /// Services Marketplace subscription. For more information, see Amazon RDS
  /// for Db2 licensing options in the Amazon RDS User Guide . This setting
  /// doesn't apply to Amazon Aurora or RDS Custom DB instances. Valid Values:
  /// RDS for Db2 - bring-your-own-license | marketplace-license RDS for
